Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.66,0:00:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we get superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.06,0:00:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we get superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.88,0:00:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.68,0:00:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we get superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.34,0:00:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.30,0:00:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we get superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.28,0:00:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a monster deep within\Nyour dreams, taking aim.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.70,0:00:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,for your heart so it would\Nseem Stand tall and read,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.76,0:00:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,go to hell and jump for\Nparadise Every time dangerous,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.90,0:00:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,dangerous We like it serious, serious,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.28,0:00:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,oh Looking deep in the dream\Nthere is the one in pain
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.66,0:00:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Turns out that's the one who\Nmeans the most to you today
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.06,0:00:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Adventure calls now,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.92,0:00:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,let's go The balls filled between us, they\Nwill show Still what we don't know Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.68,0:01:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,working hard together Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.38,0:01:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got superpowers. Got to dream.\NDespite the rivalry, Gotta see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.82,0:01:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,it through We're living in you\NThere's even charm in failure Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.20,0:01:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,we've got superpowers
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.48,0:01:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,All the love and the tears\NIn the world we're in
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.10,0:01:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,United gently bringing up Our thought\Nagain, yeah We're the foolish ones we love,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.64,0:01:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll carry on
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.58,0:01:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Till we see the light, the sun will rise
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.28,0:01:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The greatest fight at its core is\Nagainst myself forevermore Come on,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.66,0:01:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,let's do it now,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.60,0:01:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go. The balls filled between us,\Nthey will show. So what we don't know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.86,0:01:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,that's what we call adventure Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.12,0:01:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,we've got superpowers Got to dream\Ndespite the rivalry Gotta see
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.62,0:02:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It through believing in you.\NThere's even charm in failure. Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.00,0:02:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,we've got superpowers
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.10,0:02:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.46,0:02:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.48,0:02:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers Yes, we've got superpowers
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.56,0:02:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers Yes, we're the superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.04,0:02:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.22,0:02:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we're the superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.14,0:02:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Candy! Candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.52,0:02:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Slug! E-e!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.52,0:02:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about, Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.88,0:03:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.04,0:03:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.80,0:03:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If that hits us, we're all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.26,0:03:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We can go to burst, can't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.00,0:03:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.58,0:03:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We're short on Call!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.12,0:03:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Pedro!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.40,0:03:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,He sacrificed himself to save us enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.28,0:03:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.54,0:03:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready for my kids now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.12,0:03:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Little lickety-minutes, please! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.20,0:03:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't do this, Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.32,0:03:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sink the ship, and you'll\Nsink the cake along with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.78,0:03:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.08,0:04:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Quickly! Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.00,0:04:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.12,0:04:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems about right, Jinbe?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.66,0:04:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.57,0:04:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's good enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.49,0:04:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This is madness!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.70,0:04:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You're steering the ship and\Nmoving the sails by hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.02,0:04:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami! The wind?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.04,0:04:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a strong gust\Ncoming from the south!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.16,0:04:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.66,0:04:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.92,0:04:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.28,0:04:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm tacky!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.62,0:04:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Straight into the wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.48,0:04:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If you turn, we'll crush\Nit in the wave, won't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.10,0:04:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Not if we can get inside the green room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.08,0:04:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.64,0:05:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.98,0:05:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what's the green room?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.48,0:05:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.42,0:05:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are we going into the lake, Stephen?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.92,0:05:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.68,0:05:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The green room is like a\Nmetaphor for heaven, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.80,0:05:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.71,0:05:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I might be seeing you\Nsooner than I thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.36,0:05:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.48,0:05:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't just surf your\Nway out of this mess!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.66,0:05:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry, Pedro!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.52,0:05:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, hang on, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.94,0:06:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Are you guys okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.38,0:06:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.30,0:06:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.08,0:06:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone, say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.62,0:06:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoe, in heaven, it's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.32,0:06:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a damn fine ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.06,0:06:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The green room is a brief wave room\Nthat forms inside a collapsing wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.44,0:06:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I used to play in these often as a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.12,0:06:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,They're quite popular\Nwith young fishermen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.98,0:06:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.92,0:06:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.56,0:06:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We're inside the wave!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.50,0:06:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.96,0:06:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We're sailing through!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.84,0:07:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a fine vessel\Nand a fine navigator.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.00,0:07:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,With a strong helmsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.16,0:07:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This ship is invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.50,0:07:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Unreal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.76,0:07:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so agile and fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.16,0:07:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Like this ship's part of his own body.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.06,0:07:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen a helmsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.86,0:07:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Steal like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.94,0:07:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're cool, Jinbe.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.26,0:07:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So we're not gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.40,0:07:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is my cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.66,0:07:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.56,0:07:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Not ideal, but fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.62,0:07:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,They got what they deserved,\Nthe little scoundrels.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.26,0:07:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,My little lie about the wedding\Ncake was swallowed by the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.62,0:07:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Otakuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.02,0:07:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Better's better here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.02,0:08:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We took care of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.90,0:08:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.76,0:08:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Brooke! Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.02,0:08:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me! Chopper! Koby!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.42,0:08:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oopsie-daisy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.02,0:08:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.26,0:08:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess we're not invading after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.30,0:08:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The plan's a wash, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.18,0:08:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The ship sank.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.58,0:08:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you'll just have\Nto burn down something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.80,0:08:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.76,0:08:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.60,0:08:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The other side of the mirror doesn't\Nlook like it's underwater to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.08,0:08:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.48,0:08:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.70,0:08:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, fine. Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.40,0:08:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We've still got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.76,0:08:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot one more round just to be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.64,0:08:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.96,0:08:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The mirror broke all of a sudden!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.44,0:08:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does this have to be so complicated?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.48,0:08:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you break the mirror?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.30,0:09:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy needs that to come back\Nto the Sunny, doesn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.22,0:09:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll take all I've got to\Nbeat the guy I'm fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.84,0:09:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to break every mirror on the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.56,0:09:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, Luffy will get\Nhurt trying to protect us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.54,0:09:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.45,0:09:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, we can't get in his way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.38,0:09:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the captain's orders now, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.26,0:09:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They still have some mirrors left.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.46,0:09:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I see one, Joska—we all see it, Mascar.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.60,0:09:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.04,0:09:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,to start some fires anytime, anyplace!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.86,0:09:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If it looks like a mirror,\Nthen smash it. Understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.00,0:09:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,me
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.44,0:09:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.40,0:09:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He-he-he!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.14,0:09:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.86,0:09:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.74,0:10:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.16,0:10:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did the mirror break?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.56,0:10:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, only one more!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.12,0:10:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't think they're alive, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.78,0:10:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Pedos said they sank and he\Nwouldn't have a reason to lie to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.30,0:10:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The mirror's probably shattered\Nbecause of the water pressure then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.36,0:10:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.00,0:10:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're right, that does make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.16,0:10:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's not right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.32,0:10:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, Puffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.10,0:10:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You okay? Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.04,0:10:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.70,0:10:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to talk, so get\Naway from the enemies!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.18,0:10:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So you guys are okay after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.82,0:10:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.73,0:10:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hats, run and stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.24,0:11:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.82,0:11:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That candy guy told people to Sonny sink!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.62,0:11:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It was gonna sink until\NKaido bailed us out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.52,0:11:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish he could've seen it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.04,0:11:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd be at the bottom of the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.58,0:11:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, we're fine, so don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.46,0:11:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And also, we broke all the\Nmirrors on the ship like you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.44,0:11:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Good work!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.48,0:11:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.66,0:11:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nice that the enemies can't come\Nto the ship, but now neither can you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.22,0:11:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.00,0:11:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.52,0:11:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's what I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.96,0:11:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't even have a plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.62,0:11:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortunately for you, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.96,0:11:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji is baking a cake on\NKaku Island. He'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.58,0:11:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We're headed there right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.76,0:11:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's gonna be at least\N10 hours before we make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.38,0:11:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So around 1 a .m.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.82,0:12:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,First things first, kick that guy's ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.00,0:12:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Then look for a mirror\Nthat leads to Kaku Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.76,0:12:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And we'll meet you there, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.00,0:12:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm stuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.04,0:12:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.94,0:12:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.86,0:12:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.58,0:12:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.58,0:12:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You got this right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.50,0:12:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.52,0:13:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be a good sign, can it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.08,0:13:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Still there, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.94,0:13:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.16,0:13:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell us you're okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.28,0:13:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.28,0:13:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Willow Mochi
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.00,0:14:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Max. Max.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.38,0:14:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Max.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.04,0:14:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.26,0:15:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Get to that island as fast as you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.14,0:15:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll wrap this up in no time, so\Nyou better not keep me waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.84,0:15:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.98,0:15:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, see you soon! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.54,0:15:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy will probably start coming\Nafter us again, so keep watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.12,0:15:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.38,0:15:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go to the observation deck, Carrot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.22,0:15:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Okie Dock, Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.92,0:16:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,My friends are waiting, you'll say.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.84,0:16:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna die here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.68,0:16:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You realize those may be your last words.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.42,0:16:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,My friends are waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.50,0:16:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to die here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.40,0:16:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only natural for you to\Nrage against your own demise.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.58,0:17:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But all the same, this will be your end.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.02,0:17:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You could fight, but if you just keeled\Nover right now that would be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.74,0:17:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,a tree stop calling me a tree and\Ndon't act like your Candy attitude will
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.98,0:17:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Get you through this, my brother's more\Nthan strong. He's undefeated, unbeatable.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.88,0:17:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,a warrior of superhuman talent who's\Nnever fallen on his back a single day
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.34,0:17:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, the moment he was born, he\Nstood on his feet and slept on a chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.36,0:17:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,So the legend says, he's never lain\Ndown and never been knocked down either.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.94,0:17:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, he's downright\Ndisrespectful to the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.88,0:17:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,His bearing is always noble,\Ncool-headed and strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.28,0:17:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There's not a single flaw about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.82,0:17:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's our big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.82,0:18:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the shining star\Nof the Charlotte family.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.60,0:18:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,whereas you're nothing\Nbut a wee little brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.06,0:18:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha, you should apologize with your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.52,0:18:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up, tree, just go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.52,0:18:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You keep your hands off my little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.40,0:18:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Katakuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.84,0:18:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Watching thrust!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.80,0:19:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That was close!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.98,0:19:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Stabbing me wasn't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.84,0:19:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The name of this trident\Nis mole by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.60,0:19:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I start with a hand or a foot,\Nwhich would you like to lose first?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.32,0:19:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll sever it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.58,0:19:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Start with a stupid head, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.98,0:19:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you shut the hell up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.90,0:20:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.80,0:20:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant rifle!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.84,0:20:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I was listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.58,0:20:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.66,0:20:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard what you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.70,0:20:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I know where you've been attempting\Nto meet up with your crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.24,0:20:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanna play with the big wave again, Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.36,0:20:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, I promise it'll be fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.18,0:20:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you even listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.16,0:20:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.18,0:20:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The ship hasn't sunk yet, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.06,0:20:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And what makes you think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.10,0:20:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard them talking, I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.70,0:20:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't see the size of\Nthe candy monster's wave!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.64,0:20:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It swallowed that ship whole!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.94,0:20:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Escape was not lickety-likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.72,0:21:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,How they did it doesn't really matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.30,0:21:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The point is, I'm certain\Nthey're still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.76,0:21:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And they will be showing up at\NCacao Island after midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.26,0:21:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's exactly what they\Npromised. That Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.44,0:21:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no question.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.84,0:21:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But they have no clue that I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.68,0:21:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's prepare a welcoming\Nparty for them, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.12,0:21:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.10,0:21:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Turns out that cake you want is\Nin Chocolatown on Cacao Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.26,0:21:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head there now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.86,0:21:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I lickety-like to her out of desperation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.08,0:21:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But if this plays out, it'll be like\NI was telling the truth all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.12,0:21:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Pudding is baking the cake\Nat Cacao Island, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.88,0:21:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,This could still go south, but it looks\Nlike the pieces are falling into place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.54,0:22:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wedding cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.70,0:22:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.80,0:22:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.54,0:22:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.48,0:22:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Nuts Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.50,0:22:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you guys even lickety-listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.24,0:22:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not where the\Nwedding cake is going, Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.18,0:22:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to head to Cacao\NIsland or you won't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.12,0:22:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wedding cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.22,0:22:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, but not there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.22,0:22:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, I'm going to lickety-lose my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.02,0:22:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He never learns.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.64,0:22:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,How about this? Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.34,0:22:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.34,0:23:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Aaaaaaahhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.38,0:23:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.16,0:23:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.80,0:23:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.04,0:23:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,He knows exactly where I'm going\Nto dodge every single time!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.78,0:23:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Swearing me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.86,0:23:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The feeling is mutual.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.14,0:24:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No one's ever evaded so many\Nof my attacks for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.26,0:24:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's stressful.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.80,0:24:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you trying to grab my mole?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.30,0:24:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll get it next time for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.84,0:24:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Flowing mochi.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.24,0:24:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.44,0:24:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We're turned into mochi!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.92,0:25:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is just like what Doe Flamingo did!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.82,0:25:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen closely, rookie.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.34,0:25:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,My Devil Fruit's power ascended.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.38,0:25:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,They've reached a new horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.20,0:25:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,A higher state known as awakening.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.80,0:25:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only natural that\Nmy ability has awakened.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.56,0:25:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.14,0:25:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's no pot of tea to\Nhelp you escape this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.72,0:25:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I could just chop you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.56,0:25:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Or I could let the mochi\Nsuffocate you on its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.66,0:25:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How would you like to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.02,0:25:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.98,0:25:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Fourth gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.22,0:25:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This just got interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.58,0:26:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Something isn't right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.32,0:26:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Feels like we should have gotten the\Nlocation of Straw Hat's ship by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.12,0:26:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Does this mean something\Nhappened to the territory slugs?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.76,0:26:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Peckhams, that's enough out of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.64,0:26:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop your crying already!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.72,0:26:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm sad about Pedro!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.72,0:26:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sympathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.58,0:26:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Pedro was like a brother to Peckham.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.76,0:26:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So having him meet such an end,\Nc'est une tragédie terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.02,0:26:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What, are you friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.24,0:26:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.84,0:26:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't die just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.64,0:26:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The dawn of the new world is coming soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.04,0:26:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't rest until I've seen it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.32,0:26:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This should be more than enough\Nto undo all of your little tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.66,0:26:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That's dynamite!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.32,0:26:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Adios.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.54,0:27:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Friend of all, this came\Nto me as a bit of a shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.46,0:27:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw Pedro five years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.92,0:27:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting part of this part.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.34,0:27:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,To hold on to every moment of his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.50,0:27:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That my mom might spare.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.68,0:27:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's that same man was willing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.56,0:27:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,To sacrifice his life and on his tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.58,0:27:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,To help the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.28,0:27:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You getting at something here?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.92,0:27:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps we're making an error.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.32,0:27:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, there are many who have paid\Nthe price for underestimating Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.02,0:27:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you proposing?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.70,0:27:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Simply that we should be\Nmore cautious on this matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.82,0:27:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama won't lose to some brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.84,0:27:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You're implying that Straw Hat is\Nso weak that it's part dangerous?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.48,0:27:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Compared to Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.72,0:27:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat is nothing but a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.06,0:27:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, you would still say that\Nlooking at the state of the Shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.30,0:28:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Clearly that was an accident!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.36,0:28:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And the territory slugs!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.02,0:28:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it an accident as well that\Nthey're failing to function right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.94,0:28:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.85,0:28:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You think they planned all of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.82,0:28:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That we're playing into some trap?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.70,0:28:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll put it this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.50,0:28:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,En Serious, unexpected incidents has\Nbeen occurring ever since they got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.94,0:28:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,A champion's pride comes before a fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.60,0:28:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it not our job to protect\NMama's honor? Therefore,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.74,0:28:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,in order to prevent further accidents,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.60,0:28:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,let us dispatch a fleet to protect\Nthe borders of our territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.42,0:28:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Mondore? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.56,0:28:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The Lady Custard would\Nlike to speak with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.40,0:28:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Custard was chasing\Nafter Veggie, wasn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.18,0:28:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, this is Mondore.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.12,0:29:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You would better have\Nsome good news for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.44,0:29:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.08,0:29:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The thing is, we lost\NVeggie's ship. You won!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.26,0:29:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,For some reason, the territory slugs\Naren't sending us its location. Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.28,0:29:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not just us. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.04,0:29:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We were trying to drag Straw Hat's ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.02,0:29:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,and the damn territory slugs\Nweren't giving us a thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.40,0:29:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.98,0:29:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Just go and look for\NVeggie on your own. Do not.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.30,0:29:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And I repeat, do not\Nlet him escape. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.84,0:29:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Click.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.75,0:29:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, go check on them right away. On who?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.24,0:29:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you\Nthink I'm talking about
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.00,0:29:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,on the territory slugs screwing us over?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.20,0:29:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir. Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.88,0:29:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get to the bottom of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.40,0:29:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't think they'd give\Nup the chase quite so easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.62,0:29:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Wonder what the deal is.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.80,0:29:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe the territory slugs don't know\Nwhere we're trying to go, little old.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.34,0:29:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they jammed or what? Dunno.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.98,0:30:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But if they were operating like usual,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.14,0:30:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,then our transponder\Nsnails would be reacting,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.44,0:30:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,wouldn't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.35,0:30:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe they're sleeping\Non the job, little old.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.64,0:30:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.68,0:30:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never heard of that happening before.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.32,0:30:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not complaining, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.56,0:30:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep hauling ass, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.40,0:30:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,My lady is waiting for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.84,0:30:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Head this ship straight to Cacao\NIsland to be quick about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.14,0:30:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Nasorta calling from Jerma's ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.50,0:30:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd the battle go?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.70,0:30:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Good news?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.02,0:30:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We marched in with 10,000\Nsoldiers and crushed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.88,0:31:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Their kingdom is devastated.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.66,0:31:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.12,0:31:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You had me worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.56,0:31:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.78,0:31:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Jerma's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.12,0:31:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,With our strength, it was easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.74,0:31:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick question, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.98,0:31:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't destroy the manufacturing\Nsystem for the clones, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.34,0:31:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Course not. Don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.58,0:31:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that was our objective.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.44,0:31:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But other than that, the place is wrecked.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.24,0:31:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,As it should be, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.38,0:31:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Those chair-ma-grunts were doomed\Nthe moment we had them in our sights.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.66,0:31:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on with\NStrawhead and his friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.44,0:31:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.68,0:31:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They made it out to sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.88,0:31:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,They're trying to escape to the west.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.80,0:31:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's no matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.50,0:31:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll catch them soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.94,0:31:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll leave that in your capable hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.64,0:31:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, and nice work.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.12,0:31:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Click.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.00,0:31:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, that was pretty easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.60,0:31:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.46,0:32:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy is safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.90,0:32:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.04,0:32:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing tying us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.64,0:32:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Set sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.02,0:32:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You know where.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.88,0:32:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.84,0:32:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Muscle balloon!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.88,0:32:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I tire of watching this\Nmeaningless future play out.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.86,0:32:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Why should I allow you to power up?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.58,0:32:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.90,0:33:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, I won't underestimate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.48,0:33:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Mirror Moshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.12,0:33:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The ceiling spoke to you too?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.44,0:33:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap, if that comes down on me,\NI'm going to be buried alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.04,0:33:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you'll suffocate.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.02,0:33:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, it ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.98,0:33:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry to kill you in such an undignified\Nmanner, but I was getting a bit impatient,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.04,0:33:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.95,0:33:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you gave me so much trouble, I'm\N40 minutes late for today's merienda,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.14,0:33:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,my afternoon snack.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.94,0:33:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Your suffering will end soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.50,0:34:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This is goodbye, Straw Hat.
